  "version": "1",
  "text": "Your outfit is built around soft textures and a warm, autumnal palette. The beige wool dress provides a cozy foundation, while the light blue knitted cardigan adds a delicate layer of color and texture. Grey suede heels ground the look with an understated elegance, and the woven bag in a matching tone ties everything together seamlessly.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep the cardigan open to showcase the dress beneath, letting its loose fit contrast nicely with the streamlined silhouette of your leggings and shoes.",
    "Let the bag hang from your arm or shoulder rather than holding it tightly; this relaxed way of wearing matches the breezy feel of the knitwear."
  ],
